Z||000019||Jaei Sun||11-03-2001||09:33 PM||||Thanks all for the compliments... I'm very proud of it.  Now to answer questions:<P>I removed all the body panels off the car (INCLUDING the roof and fastback clip)  Did all the prep work myself, and had my brother paint all the pieces off the car in his garage.  The cost?  2 cases of beer and that's it!  He laid the paint down so smooth,  the car still needs to be wet sanded and buffed!<P>The trim is white... and the wheels/tires are going up for sale for like $550 and I'm picking up some white 17" 7 spoke Tenzos or 6 spoke ADRs to go in their place.<P>I'm doing a white/blue/black theme with the car... those are the only colors I want on it.<P>The front turn signals are clears they're backup lights from some old 80s GM (can't remember what model) and the backup lights on the rear are backup lights for a Truck/Trailer.<P>I'm planning to get white whipper blades and paint the interior white/black with blue highlights (I've already painted my Daily Driver white and black so I know how to do it so it looks good).<P>And next summer I'm trying to get a 3800 S/C to get dropped in with the 5-speed. <P>------------------<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://home.mn.rr.com/fierojaei/Jaei_blue.gif"> ||||reg||1
